# QA: tools/scripts/smoke.script with a screenshot after every step (diagnoses where it stalls).
wait ui
0.5 shot s00_ui_ready
wait screen title
0.3 shot s01_before_confirm
0.0 nav keyboardA confirm          # Title: any button
wait screen main
1.0 shot s02_after_title
0.0 nav keyboardA down             # Quick Race
0.3 nav keyboardA confirm
wait screen trackSelect
1.0 shot s03_track_select
0.3 nav keyboardA confirm          # Track select: the focused track → its Choose car button
0.3 nav keyboardA confirm          # → Car select
wait screen carSelect
1.0 shot s04_car_select
1.0 nav keyboardA confirm          # race
2.0 shot s05_after_race_confirm
3.0 shot s06_later
wait racing
1.0 shot s07_racing
1.0 exit
